  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Investment for Socio-Economic Empowerment, Peace and Security (RISE-PS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The RISE-PS project aims to create employment opportunities and improve access to basic social services in Cabo Delgado, targeting youth, women, displaced populations, and vulnerable communities. It adopts a proactive, integrated approach to address the root causes of fragility. By rehabilitating community-driven social infrastructure, supporting youth- and women-led enterprises, providing vocational and entrepreneurship training, fostering private sector growth through SME villages and industri</narrative>
  </description>
